{
  "type": "Game.Scripts.Notes.NoteDef",
  "Title": "",
  "Text": "After Incident X, which was your fault, you have been exiled to the old laboratory wing. No one has set foot here in years.\n\nYour task: clear the building of clutter and put everything in its proper place. Large items go on the pallets; small ones go on the shelves.\n\nResources are stored separately, by the entrance.\n\nSome of the furniture has been destroyed, and you will have to repair it. Use whatever resources you find in the lab.\n\nPerhaps then you will earn back their trust.\n\nWARNING! UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES ARE YOU TO REPAIR THE TELEPORTER.",
